+  rule <k> Subscript(E1, E2) => E1 ~> subscriptIndex(E2) ... </k>
+  rule <k> A:List ~> subscriptIndex(E2) => E2 ~> getAt(A) ... </k>
+  rule <k> I:Int ~> getAt(A) => A [ I ] ... </k>
